            "translation": {
              "en": "Who provides eight brāhmaṇas to learn it, becomes vigorous as Sūrya. Observing the reflection of a solar eclipse from the shore of a great river, while also whispering this perfect mantra, one becomes: - free from the great obstacle, - free from the great disease, - free from the great sin, - free from the great detriment, - he becomes omniscient, he becomes omniscient. For he who knows so, (what is said is confidential.)"
